      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Brandon has turned up some of the higher radon results in Manitoba's surveys. A three-month test in your basement tells you where your own house sits.</p>
